   "lines": [
    "Drove Tom Lee over to",
    "the Athletic games",
    "which were very good;",
    "and thence to a",
    "garden party at",
    "the Dixwells. It was",
    "beautiful moonlight,",
    "and I drove Alice",
    "home."
